RGqI6QZSI5pLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTAewf74Zm-ELeUlDd7IkCA2mSr8RA-T7CvIxheetbkYw&oe=6AFC6BD3"}, "display_name": "Minifunkids Immersive Ocean", "keywords": ["neurodiversity", "autism", "sensory", "education", "ADHD"], "long_description": "Explore a calm underwater world created for learning through gentle, low-pressure play.\nMinifunkids Immersive Ocean includes four ocean-themed VR activities that encourage attention, visual matching, direction recognition and object classification. Clear instructions, simple interactions and a peaceful visual environment make the experience easy to understand and comfortable to explore.\nThe app is designed for mixed-age audiences aged 10 and over and was created with neurodivergent learners and users with special educational needs in mind. It can be enjoyed at home or used as a supportive educational resource by families, educators and professionals.\nKey features:\nFour guided VR activities\nCalm underwater environment\nSimple and intuitive interactions\nNo chat or advertising\nNo in-app purchases\nNo external account required\nMinifunkids Immersive Ocean is an educational VR experience. It is not a medical device and does not provide diagnosis, medical treatment or therapy.\nMinifunkids Immersive Ocean is not directed to children under 10 years of age.", "short_description": "A calm, ocean-themed VR learning experience with four simple activities designed for mixed-age audiences. Minifunkids Immersive Ocean supports attention, visual matching, direction recognition and object classification through gentle, low-pressure play. Designed with neurodivergent learners and special educational needs in mind."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://minifunkids.com/immersive-ocean-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MINIFUNKIDS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://minifunkids.com/immersive-ocean/", "categor